Error [E0003]: `#Target(Web)` isn't valid on a module
  --> tests/ui/web_target_web_on_module.jet:1:14
    |
  1 | #Target(Web) module widgets {
    |              ^^^^^^
 Why: `Web` is a file-level default-backend marker, not a partition ceiling
 Fix: Move `#Target(Web)` to the top of the file, outside any module; use `#Target(Wasm)` or `#Target(JS)` on a module
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003

Error [E0003]: Expected a call, binding, assignment, or `return`, found `}`
  --> tests/ui/web_target_web_on_module.jet:3:1
    |
  3 | }
    | ^
 Why: Inside a function body, write a call, binding, assignment, or `return`
 Fix: e.g. print("hello") or x :: 1
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0003
